mons, dragons and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many optional sex scenes with orcs, monsters and demons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A medium length adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some QoL stuff like fast-traveling and fast-forward (hold space)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3d and 3rd person</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906740/extras/cedae78a159c65f8ebfb14c92671fe47.avif?t=1758296420\" width=310 height=306 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3906740?t=1758296420","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906740/ccbc967be24d6a6d27e5833311d1898258e9dac3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758296420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906740/ba2f338ed43ac528aa1baec140075887214b400d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758296420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906740/ba2f338ed43ac528aa1baec140075887214b400d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758296420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Contains consensual bdsm, sex scenes and male on male domination, often with fantasy characters like orcs, demons and dragons. Bodily fluids are shown in some scenes."},"demos":[{"appid":3908420,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One small\u00a0mistake was all it took. Now your soul belongs to a demon. He'